  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal, weighty word for defeat. More serious in tone than ⟦{負|ま}け→負け：02569_make⟧ (loss, casual). Used in sports, politics, military, and business contexts. The verb form {敗北|はいぼく}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ means \"to be defeated.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {敗北|はいぼく}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{喫|きっ}する→喫する：29124_kissuru⟧: to suffer a defeat\n- {敗北|はいぼく}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{認|みと}める→認める：02429_mitomeru⟧: to concede defeat\n- {敗北|はいぼく}{感|かん}: sense of defeat\n- {大|だい}{敗北|はいぼく}: crushing defeat\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{負|ま}け→負け：02569_make⟧: loss, defeat (casual, everyday)\n- ⟦{敗戦|はいせん}→敗戦：12917_haisen⟧: defeat in war/a game (more specific to war or sports matches)\n- ⟦{惨敗|ざんぱい}→惨敗：08236_zanpai⟧: crushing defeat, devastating loss",
